acceptance_criteria: package.json and pnpm-lock.yaml resolve tsx 4.23.11; pnpm audit remains clean and only deliberately deferred incompatible majors remain outdated; the exact dependency head passes coverage 100/100/100/100 and the complete quality/security/package gate
value: Keep the executable TypeScript toolchain current without widening supported-runtime constraints.
outcome: "A reproducible, fully verified patch-only dependency refresh."
why_now: The live dependency inventory found one compatible patch update while the requested broad SDK/CLI tranche is active.
